====================================
- P1158/P1159/P1160: cross-type AB reclaim of freed canvas context DEAD
  on our console (55 stages, all crashes; same-type control survives).
- P1161: MetadataTable overflow (CVE-2026-64784) CONFIRMED LIVE: 171MB
